      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">No transfer station in the Surf Coast Shire takes asbestos, so a Torquay job runs by different rules to one in Geelong. Get the material tested first, then get a quote from a licensed removalist.</p>
